{"speciesId":188,"names":{"fr":"Floravol","es":"Skiploom","en":"Skiploom","ja":"ポポッコ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"The bloom on top of its head opens and closes as the temperature fluc­ tuates up and down."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It spreads its petals to absorb sunlight. It also floats in the air to get closer to the sun."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"As soon as it rains, it closes its flower and hides in the shade of a tree to avoid getting wet."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SKIPLOOM’s flower blossoms when the temperature rises above 64 degrees F. How much the flower opens depends on the temperature. For that reason, this POKéMON is sometimes used as a thermometer."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SKIPLOOM’s flower blossoms when the temperature rises above 64 degrees F. How much the flower opens depends on the temperature. For that reason, this POKéMON is sometimes used as a thermometer."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It blossoms when the temperature rises above 64 degrees F. Because its flower’s blooming changes with the temperature, it is sometimes used as a thermometer."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It spreads its petals to absorb sunlight. It also floats in the air to get closer to the sun."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The bloom on top of its head opens and closes as the temperature fluctuates up and down."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It blooms when the weather warms. It floats in the sky to soak up as much sunlight as possible."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It blooms when the weather warms. It floats in the sky to soak up as much sunlight as possible."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It blooms when the weather warms. It floats in the sky to soak up as much sunlight as possible."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"The bloom on top of its head opens and 